  "step_3": "The decision reason requires consideration of the sure outcome (0 Euros) and the weighted differences from it. The individual only considers the probability of achieving 0 Euros (the sure outcome), without analyzing the differences between the outcomes and the sure outcome, nor computing or justifying a weighted sum of those differences. The justification is based solely on the probability of a sure outcome (0 Euros), which is a partial component of the reason, but not the full rule. The rule involves a specific calculation (sum of sure outcome plus weighted differences), which is absent from the report. Therefore, the individual did not apply the full decision reason. While the individual touches on a related aspect (the sure outcome), they fail to use the rule involving differences and their weighted probabilities. Thus, the decision reason was not used in full.",
